  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Civil Society for Equality and Environment Consortium Svalorna LA 2025-2028</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Svalorna Latinamerika CSO strategi 2025-2028 - Civil Society for Equality and Environment Consortium F&#xf6;r&#xe4;ldral&#xf6;saBarn 2025-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen ska bidra till &#xf6;kad effektivitet inom civilsamh&#xe4;llesorganisationer och r&#xe4;ttighetsb&#xe4;rare att agera f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringsakt&#xf6;rer, fr&#xe4;mja j&#xe4;mlikhet och m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter, skydda regnskogar, klimatresiliens, och klimatmitigering, genom p&#xe5;verkan p&#xe5; ansvarsb&#xe4;rare och deltagande i policyutveckling och offentlig debatt.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution aims to increase effectiveness within civil society organisations and right-holders to act agents of change, promote equality and human rights, protect rainforests, climate resilience, and climate mitigation, through advocacy targeting duty bearers, and participation in policy development and public debate.</narrative>
  </description>
